resources.string:
The app talks to:
• your own server, which stores everything you enter;
• GitHub, only to look for updates (on start if switched on, otherwise when you tap “Check”);
• Google Play services for barcode scanning and passkeys; on-device text recognition (ML Kit) may send usage statistics to Google;
• other websites (BrickLink, instructions) only when you tap a link, in the browser.
No tracking, no advertising, no analytics.
